<<elseif $LucasSocialRank >= 1>> <br>

    <span style="color:Pink"> You both seem to notice this at the same time, your cheeks turning red simultaneously. You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>, blushing slightly; it’s not like this wouldn’t be the first time you kissed. So, with a sly smirk, you say the line before the kiss, leaning closer to the boy. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ cheeks go brighter, realizing what you are asking of him.</span> <br>

